cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tabula in teaching, research or writing, please cite it as below."
title: "Tabula: The Body, as It Was Written"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, engraved human body in which every part carries the story of
  who worked it out, how they did it, and what they got wrong first, across
  3,600 years. Every historical claim is cited to at least two sources, one of
  them scholarly, and checked against a published verification method.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ali
    family-names: Khan
repository-code: "https://github.com/akhanrepo/tabula"
url: "https://tabula-anatomy.netlify.app"
